WEBVTT

00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:07.460
See you tomorrow, buddy!

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:10.980
McQueen and Sally
parked beneath a tree,

00:00:11.060 --> 00:00:14.700
K-i-s-somethin'-somethin'-somethin'-t!

00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:17.460
[laughing]

00:00:17.540 --> 00:00:20.140
[revving engine] Whoa, whoa, whoa.

00:00:20.220 --> 00:00:21.620
[chuckling]

00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:27.420
Number one. Number one...
Ah, number one!

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:30.940
- Ah, this is nice.
- Hey, Stickers.

00:00:30.980 --> 00:00:32.420
[both scream]

00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:35.140
- I'm sorry.
- You scared me. You gotta be careful.

00:00:35.180 --> 00:00:37.300
I scared myself
scaring you scaring me.

00:00:37.420 --> 00:00:40.500
- I mean, I wasn't like scared scared.
- No, of course not. No.

00:00:40.580 --> 00:00:43.340
- I was more...
- I overheard you talkin' to Mater.

00:00:43.380 --> 00:00:46.100
When? Just now?
What, what did, what did you hear?

00:00:46.180 --> 00:00:48.180
Something about a helicopter ride.

00:00:48.660 --> 00:00:51.420
Oh, yeah. Yeah, he got
a kick out of that, didn't he?

00:00:51.500 --> 00:00:53.380
- Did you mean it?
- What?

00:00:53.460 --> 00:00:55.500
- That you'll get him a ride.
- Who knows?

00:00:55.540 --> 00:00:58.580
First things first. I gotta
get outta here and make the race.

00:00:58.660 --> 00:01:00.660
Uh-huh.

00:01:00.740 --> 00:01:03.940
You know... Mater trusts you.

00:01:05.300 --> 00:01:07.700
Yeah, OK.

00:01:07.740 --> 00:01:10.420
- Did you mean that?
- What?

00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:16.140
Was it just a "Yeah, OK",
or "Yeah... OK" or "Yeah, o-OK"?

00:01:16.180 --> 00:01:18.860
Look, I'm exhausted.
It's kinda been a long day.

00:01:19.620 --> 00:01:22.460
Yeah, OK. G'night.

00:01:24.860 --> 00:01:26.020
[groans] Oh...

00:01:26.100 --> 00:01:28.340
Hey, thank you.

00:01:30.620 --> 00:01:32.300
What did you just say?

00:01:32.980 --> 00:01:35.220
You know,
thanks for lettin' me stay here.

00:01:35.260 --> 00:01:39.140
It's nice to be out of the impound,
and this is... It's great.

00:01:39.220 --> 00:01:42.740
- Newly refurbished, right?
- Yeah.

00:01:43.700 --> 00:01:46.220
- G'night.
- Good night.

00:01:50.380 --> 00:01:51.900
Hmm.

00:01:57.740 --> 00:02:00.460
[reveille plays] [reveille plays]

00:02:04.740 --> 00:02:07.340
[♪ Jimi Hendrix: Star Spangled Banner]

00:02:07.420 --> 00:02:10.420
Will you turn
that disrespectful junk off?

00:02:10.500 --> 00:02:14.340
Respect the classics, man.
It's Hendrix!

00:02:15.700 --> 00:02:18.340
[groaning]

00:02:18.420 --> 00:02:21.140
[breathing rapidly]

00:02:21.220 --> 00:02:22.740
[muttering]

00:02:22.820 --> 00:02:25.260
[fast-paced electronic music]

00:02:25.340 --> 00:02:26.860
Ah!

00:02:29.300 --> 00:02:32.260
- [mooing loudly]
- [screaming]

00:02:33.260 --> 00:02:34.380
No!

00:02:36.980 --> 00:02:38.220
[yelling loudly]

00:02:38.700 --> 00:02:40.500
[mooing]

00:02:40.580 --> 00:02:43.860
- No! [gasping]
- [alarm beeping]

00:02:44.260 --> 00:02:45.660
I gotta get outta here!

00:02:46.100 --> 00:02:49.060
Hey, have you seen the Sheriff?
Oh! Oh, my gosh.

00:02:49.140 --> 00:02:52.420
- Hey, what are you doin'?
- Get a good peek, city boy?

00:02:52.460 --> 00:02:55.940
[stuttering] I just need my
daily gas ration from the Sheriff.

00:02:56.060 --> 00:02:58.180
Wait for him at Flo's.
Get outta here.

00:02:58.260 --> 00:03:00.940
I've been trying
to get outta here for three days!

00:03:00.980 --> 00:03:03.460
[Sheriff] Hope you enjoyed the show!

00:03:08.980 --> 00:03:10.860
[groaning]

00:03:17.060 --> 00:03:18.860
Whoa, Doc.

00:03:18.940 --> 00:03:22.660
Time to clean out the garage, buddy,
come on.

00:03:38.500 --> 00:03:40.340
What?

00:03:41.460 --> 00:03:44.260
He has a Piston Cup?

00:03:51.340 --> 00:03:53.100
Oh, my gosh.

00:03:54.460 --> 00:03:56.500
Three Piston Cups?

00:04:08.820 --> 00:04:10.820
- [Doc] Sign says stay out.
- [gasps]

00:04:11.660 --> 00:04:14.260
You have three Piston Cups.
How could you have...

00:04:14.340 --> 00:04:17.420
I knew you couldn't drive.
I didn't know you couldn't read.

00:04:17.500 --> 00:04:20.540
- You're the Hudson Hornet!
- Wait at Flo's, like I told ya!

00:04:20.580 --> 00:04:23.140
Of course. I can't believe
I didn't see it before.

00:04:23.220 --> 00:04:24.940
You're The Fabulous Hudson Hornet!

00:04:25.020 --> 00:04:28.660
You used to hold the record for most
wins in a season. Oh, we gotta talk.

00:04:28.740 --> 00:04:31.460
- You gotta show me your tricks. Please.
- I tried that.

00:04:31.540 --> 00:04:34.260
You won three times!
Look at those trophies!

00:04:34.340 --> 00:04:37.780
You look.
All I see is a bunch of empty cups.

00:04:40.500 --> 00:04:42.940
[country music]

00:04:43.020 --> 00:04:48.340
You know, some automotive yoga
could really lower your RPM's, man.

00:04:48.420 --> 00:04:50.180
Oh, take a car wash, hippie.

00:04:50.260 --> 00:04:53.500
Yeah, look at my husband, y'all!
Whoo! That's your color!

00:04:53.580 --> 00:04:57.300
- [Ramone] Yellow, baby.
- Mmm. You smokin' hot!

00:04:57.380 --> 00:04:58.420
There he is.

00:04:58.500 --> 00:05:01.500
Oh, my gosh!
Did you know Doc is a famous racecar?

00:05:04.740 --> 00:05:07.500
- Doc? Our Doc?
- Not Doc Hudson.

00:05:07.580 --> 00:05:10.180
No, no, no, no, it's true!
He's a real racing legend.

00:05:10.260 --> 00:05:12.500
He's The Fabulous Hudson Hornet!

00:05:12.580 --> 00:05:15.900
Fabulous? I never seen Doc
drive more than 20 miles an hour.

00:05:15.940 --> 00:05:18.020
I mean, have you ever seen him race?

00:05:18.100 --> 00:05:21.700
No, but I wish I could have.
They say he was amazing!

00:05:21.780 --> 00:05:25.620
- He won three Piston Cups!
- He did what in his cup?

00:05:25.700 --> 00:05:28.020
I think the heat's
startin' to get to the boy!

00:05:28.100 --> 00:05:30.260
Well, I'll say! Look how red he is.

00:05:30.260 --> 00:05:32.700
[Ramone] I think he needs
a new coat of poly, man.

00:05:32.780 --> 00:05:35.540
- [Mater] Are you sick, buddy?
- You are lookin' peaked.

00:05:35.620 --> 00:05:37.380
He needs a new coat of poly for sure!

00:05:38.620 --> 00:05:39.620
[gas bell rings]

00:05:39.660 --> 00:05:43.220
- [Sheriff] Hey! What are you doin'?
- It's OK. You can trust me, right?

00:05:43.300 --> 00:05:45.980
I trust you, all right.
It's him I'm worried about.

00:05:46.900 --> 00:05:49.260
Hmm... I trust him.

00:05:50.220 --> 00:05:52.500
- Come on, let's take a drive.
- A drive?

00:05:52.580 --> 00:05:53.900
Yeah, a drive.

00:05:53.980 --> 00:05:57.100
Don't you big city racecars
ever just take a drive?

00:05:57.140 --> 00:05:59.860
Ah... No. No, we don't.

00:05:59.940 --> 00:06:01.060
[gas pump stops]

00:06:22.340 --> 00:06:26.180
Hey, Stickers! You comin' or what?

00:06:32.020 --> 00:06:33.180
[Flo] Mm-hm!

00:06:33.260 --> 00:06:36.740
- And you thought he was gonna run.
- Hey, can you believe it, man?

00:06:36.820 --> 00:06:39.220
He actually thought
Doc was a famous racecar!

00:06:40.260 --> 00:06:42.220
That's so too much!

00:06:44.260 --> 00:06:46.740
OK, you got me out here.
Where are we goin'?

00:06:46.820 --> 00:06:48.820
I don't know.

00:06:53.700 --> 00:06:55.700
Whoa! Yes.

00:07:08.540 --> 00:07:11.540
- [sputtering]
- [laughing]

00:07:12.500 --> 00:07:14.140
Oh! Ah-ha-ha!

00:07:14.220 --> 00:07:17.900
- Bleah!
- [chuckling]

00:07:19.380 --> 00:07:21.380
- [grunts]
- [laughs]

00:07:21.460 --> 00:07:22.740
[sputtering]

